            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Public works and paving chapters of the accounts of Ghent’s city government. 13 sample years between 1321 and 1380 were selected (1321, 1325, 1329, 1334, 1336, 1342, 1345, 1352, 1357, 1365, 1368, 1376, 1380). Printed primary sources: \n•Vuylsteke, Julius P. and Alfons van Werveke, eds. Gentsche stads- en baljuwsrekeningen, 1280-1336. Ghent: Meyer-van Loo, 1900.\n•Pauw, Napoleon de, and Julius Vuylsteke, eds. De rekeningen der stad Gent: Tijdvak van Jacob van Artevelde, 1336-1349. Ghent: A. Hoste, 1874\n•Werveke, Alfons van, ed. Gentse stads- en baljuwsrekeningen (1351-1364). Brussels: Paleis der Academiën, 1970.\n•Nicholas, David, and Walter Prevenier, eds., Gentse stads en baljuwsrekeningen (1365-1376). Brussels: Paleis der Academiën, 1999\n•Vuylsteke, Julius P. ed. De rekeningen der stad Gent: Tijdvak van Philips van Artevelde, 1376-1389. Ghent: A. Hoste, 1893"
            ]
          }
